 class=\"pp-product-card__title\">Pet Deodorizing Spray Gun Kit</h4>\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__size\">220 mL × 2</div>\n          <p class=\"pp-product-card__desc\">Professional spray system for fast coverage</p>\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__cta\">View details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></div>\n        \n        </div>\n      </article>\n    \n      <article class=\"pp-product-card\">\n        <a class=\"pp-product-card__link\" href=\"/products/pet-disinfectant-deodorizing-solution.html\" aria-label=\"Disinfectant & Deodorizing Solution\"></a>\n        <div class=\"pp-product-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/img/products/pet-disinfectant-deodorizing-solution.png?v=2\" alt=\"Disinfectant & Deodorizing Solution\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';\">\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__image-fallback\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pp-product-card__body\">\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__body\">\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__category\">deodorizing disinfecting</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pp-product-card__title\">Disinfectant & Deodorizing Solution</h4>\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__size\">350 mL</div>\n          <p class=\"pp-product-card__desc\">>99.999% kill rate on 3 pathogen strains</p>\n          <div class=\"pp-product-card__cta\">View details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></div>\n        \n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div></div></section>"
